@startuml durable-write-sequence
' ============================================================================
' Order-A durable write — "log before publish".
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/overlay/durable_write.rs (the
' DurableOverlayWrite Template-Method skeleton) + lockfree_cas.rs.
' Color key:  green = lock-free in-memory visibility (the overlay)
'             blue  = durable on-disk WAL (append + fsync)
'             amber = the committed durability frontier (watermark + commit-rank)
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam wrapWidth 150
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #37474F
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam noteBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam participantBorderColor #37474F

title Order-A durable write — "log before publish"\n(acknowledged ⟹ durable AND visible)

participant "Client" as C
participant "Overlay\n(lock-free root)" as O #C8E6C9
participant "WAL\n(append+fsync)" as W #FFCC80
participant "Watermark\n+ commit-rank" as M #FFE0B2

C -> O : insert(key, value)
activate O
note right of O #C8E6C9
  **Step 0 — present-hoist**
  NON-FAULTING membership
  read on the hot path
  (never holds the buffer
  lock → no lock-order
  deadlock)
end note
O -> O : build copy-on-write\nnode path

== Step 1 — durability gate: append the WAL record DURABLE, before any visibility ==
O -> W : append_durable\n(WalRecord): fsync |\nGroupCommit batch
activate W
W --> O : Lsn(data) — now **durable**
deactivate W
note over O, W
  Order B (CAS-then-log)
  is **rejected** — it could
  expose a visible-but-not-
  durable write. One append
  covers every CAS retry.
end note

== Step 2 — publish: visibility point = linearization point ==
loop until the root CAS wins
  O -> O : root CAS publish\n(winner linearizes)
end

== Step 3 — commit-rank, then advance the committed watermark ==
O -> W : append CommitRank\n(durable)
activate W
W --> O : Lsn(rank)
deactivate W
O -> M : mark_committed\n(data_lsn, rank_lsn)
activate M
note right of M #FFE0B2
  committed prefix
  advances to cover
  BOTH LSNs — the ONLY
  safe checkpoint_lsn
  under out-of-order
  lock-free commit
  (TLC-verified)
end note
M --> O : watermark advanced
deactivate M

O --> C : Ack — **durable AND visible**
deactivate O

note across #FFF9C4
  **Crash semantics.** A write is acknowledged *iff* its record is in the WAL:
  fsync'd ⇒ replayed on recovery · not fsync'd ⇒ was never acknowledged.
end note
@enduml
